OL,3,GNEWSAMan wanted hotel firebomb to kill
OL,4,Amigrants - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn alleged far-right extremist accused
OL,7,Fof plotting to attack a hotel housing
OL,8,Fasylum seekers in Hull wanted "to kill
OL,9,Fas many of the occupants as possible",
OL,10,Fa court has heard.
OL,12,FMikka Lee Anderson, 24, of Morpeth
OL,13,FStreet, Hull, tried to recruit an
OL,14,Faccomplice to attack the Royal Hotel in
OL,15,FFebruary, but the defendant was
OL,16,Farrested after the would-be accomplice
OL,17,Freported him to police, Newcastle Crown
OL,18,FCourt was told.
OL,20,FThe prosecution said Anderson had
OL,21,Fplanned to attack the hotel using
OL,22,Fpetrol bombs.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
