OL,3,GNEWSAMan wanted hotel firebomb to kill
OL,4,Amigrants - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe defendant denies preparing an act
OL,7,Fof terrorism including by manufacturing
OL,8,FMolotov cocktails, conducting
OL,9,Freconnaissance at the hotel and
OL,10,Fpossessing knives and other weapons for
OL,11,Fterrorist purposes.
